<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The launcher icon, drawn as Mudita draws its own for the Kompakt: Chess and Calculator, whose
     sources are public, are each one 81-unit vector named straight from the manifest, a rounded
     square in a 2.5 line against the edges with corners of about 19. Not an adaptive icon: that
     launcher adds no frame of its own, and the white background of one is not seen on a white
     screen, so the figure stood bare beside framed neighbours.

     Inside it, the figure of the phone builds, a knight in a clock's ring, in black alone: their
     two halves are told by two colours, and an E-Ink screen has one.

     The square is filled white, which Mudita's is not. On the Kompakt it changes nothing; on a
     launcher with a dark wallpaper, a black figure with nothing behind it is not seen at all. -->
